WINDOW INFORMATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hyprctl activewindow       Show active window information
  hyprctl clients            Show every open window

  Look for:
    class                    Window class
    title                    Window title
    initialClass             Original class
    initialTitle             Original title
    pid                      Process ID
    workspace                Current workspace


MONITOR INFORMATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hyprctl monitors           Show monitor configuration
  hyprctl monitors all       Show detailed monitor information

  Look for:
    name                     Monitor name
    description              Hardware description
    resolution               Current resolution
    position                 X/Y position
    scale                    Display scaling


WORKSPACE INFORMATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hyprctl workspaces         Show all workspaces
  hyprctl activeworkspace    Show current workspace


CONFIGURATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hyprctl reload             Reload configuration
  hyprctl configerrors        Show configuration errors


RULE DEBUGGING
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  1. Run: hyprctl clients
  2. Find class/title of application
  3. Compare against window rule
  4. Check for regex mismatches
  5. Run: hyprctl configerrors
  6. Reload: hyprctl reload
